CompuMed App provides simple, fast and secure access to CompuMed Smart Health Community.

- Health Checker to keep track of your vital sign readings
- Scan QR for digital attendance at panel providers
- Online appointment request and scheduling
- e-Pharmacy: Request your repeat prescriptions (Long Term Drugs) online!
- Access to your profile as well as your dependents
- Your benefits, entitlement and utilization;
- Request for Guarantee Letters, submit reimbursement claims
- Track how your claims are going through its life-cycle
- Provider locator for 2300+ GP clinics, hospitals and specialist centres nationwide;
- Setup your own Favorite list of providers;
- Use your preferred navigation app to get directions to your healthcare provider;
- BMI Calculator;
- Calorie Calculator;
- Medical Tips on most common illnesses;
- WHO Health Days calendar;
- FAQ section with relevant content;
- Feedback channel;

Disclaimer: We would like to remind our users to seek a doctor’s advice in addition to using this app and before making any medical decisions.

